rentalot — CLI tool for managing Rentalot rental properties, contacts, and workflows

Commands:
  bulk-import    Import properties from a CSV/JSON file
  completion     Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell
  config         Manage ~/.config/rentalot-cli/config.yaml
  contacts       Manage contacts (tenants, owners, prospects)
  conversations  Browse contact conversations
  properties     Manage rental properties
  sessions       Manage AI-driven chat sessions
  settings       Manage account settings
  showings       Manage property showings
  version        Display version information
  webhooks       Manage webhook endpoints
  workflows      Manage automation workflows

Flags:
      --config string  config file (default "<CONFIG_FILE>")
  -h, --help  help for rentalot
      --json  output as JSON
      --no-color  disable colored output
      --timeout duration  HTTP request timeout, including response body (must be positive) (default 30s)
  -v, --version  version for rentalot

Use rentalot [command] --help for more information about a command.

